about: deleting the last member of an expanded array takes the comma off the one above, and reports where it stood
op: deleteJsonValueAt
path: ["pipeline", "outputs"]
literal: "build/**"
=== input
{
  "pipeline": {
    "outputs": [
      "dist/**",
      "build/**"
    ]
  }
}
=== output
{
  "pipeline": {
    "outputs": [
      "dist/**"
    ]
  }
}
=== at
1
